    <briefdescription>
<para>Persistent checkpoint for a single ingestion source. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Checkpoints allow incremental ingestion: when the same source is ingested again, already-processed documents are skipped and processing resumes from the stored offset. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
